@startuml
title main user workflow diagram
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle "Authenticate as repository owner" as Start
rectangle "Create repository and choose visibility" as Create
rectangle "Issue Git token if needed" as Token
rectangle "Clone or initialize and push committed data" as Push
rectangle "Browse branch history files and tags" as Browse
rectangle "Create a branch and push changes" as Branch
rectangle "Open same-repository pull request" as Request
rectangle "Review comparison and hashes" as Review
hexagon "Refs unchanged and merge clean?" as Valid
rectangle "Owner merges reviewed change" as Merge
rectangle "Resolve conflict or refresh review" as Resolve
rectangle "Optionally queue built-in checks" as Checks
rectangle "Running worker records results" as Worker
Start --> Create
Create --> Token
Token --> Push
Push --> Browse
Browse --> Branch
Branch --> Request
Request --> Review
Review --> Valid
Valid --> Merge : Yes
Valid --> Resolve : No
Resolve --> Review
Merge --> Checks
Checks --> Worker
@enduml
